      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. it's just that \"small things\" dont really matter anymore. like, what's the point of resting just to wake up tomorrow and do the exact same thing? the math just doesn't work out. it feels like i'm just digging a hole that's deeper than i can ever climb out of, and everyone is just watching me fail.",
